WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.030
<i>I am in a frozen landscape.</i>

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>However, the snow will one day melt.</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.950
<i>Beyond every winter awaits spring.</i>

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.170
<i>That dream again...</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.220
The school's going under?!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.010
How could that possibly be?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.600
Although I am ashamed to admit it, I went a bit overboard last year.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.110
I heedlessly poured funds into Aikatsu Island and such.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.360
So you're finding it difficult to keep us afloat.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.610
Precisely!

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.570
What the heck do we do now?!

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:56.860
I have a plan.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.620
Read this through.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.620
What is this?

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:07.040
A businessman from Russia is looking to create a new dress brand.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:10.250
He has put up a large amount of capital in his search for a designer. {I had to look this up, I believe capital is correct considering what the winner gets later}

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:14.720
The winner will also receive a sponsorship.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.760
In short, if one of our students were to win...

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.760
All of our problems would be solved!

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:25.770
But only S4 are allowed their own brands.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.060
All four of them are already spoken for.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.900
I'll allow an exception.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.690
What?

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:36.280
The academy is facing a crisis. 
We have no other choice.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.910
Still, where can we find a student able to design dresses from scratch?

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.790
Cold!

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.330
Don't tell me the heating was cut!

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.210
No, I made sure to pay the electric bill!

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.670
I am privy to your predicament.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.500
Shirogane Lily.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:59.010
I have come to request permission to participate in the audition.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.940
It says Shirogane-senpai's gonna represent Four Star there.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.450
That's awesome! I wish I could've entered.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.700
Looks like they only allow one student per school.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.080
A brand audition.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.080
That's right up Lily-senpai's alley.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.580
Yeah! Plus, it's Lily-senpai's dream.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.590
She wants to start her own brand, just like Hime-senpai.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.340
She always seems to be thinking up new dress designs,

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.180
so I think it's right for her to be our rep.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.560
She's within arm's reach of her dream.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.730
We've gotta follow her lead.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:11.680
Yeah!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.480
I've got it!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.610
And at such a crucial time...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.240
We're coming in.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.280
Congratulations!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.870
Congrats on being chosen, Lily!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.490
Thank you, girls.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.410
How are you? Did your fever come down?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.750
There is no cause for concern.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.500
That's fine, then. Just don't overdo it!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:44.340
Of course. But were it Napoleon Bonaparte, he would say:

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.050
"Take time to deliberate.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:50.970
But when the time for action comes, stop thinking and advance."

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.640
I believe that time is now.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.610
Do your best. You've got this in the bag!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.900
We'll cheer for you on Aikatsu TV!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.400
I'll be on my way now.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.910
Good luck.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.240
Lily-senpai!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:14.080
Are you heading to the overnight 
audition now? Do you mind if we tag along?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.420
I'd like to lend you my support after everything you did for me at the spa resort!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.170
That is unnecessary.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:27.130
I have been creating dresses by myself from early childhood.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:31.560
Not once have I needed the help of another.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.520
Therefore, any support would be superfluous.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.150
It is time to head off.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.740
<i>This is my dream.</i>

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.360
<i>I will take hold of it myself without relying on anyone.</i>

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.010
TV Winner!

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.890
Welcome to TV Winner.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.980
In this big project, someone will get her own personal brand!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.350
Yume, the audition's started.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.350
Yeah.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:26.610
Allow me to introduce the super businessman from Russia, Mister Piroshenko! {aparently this isn't a real name, but it might be based on Poroshenko}{Piroshenko looks like a real name to my internet}

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.240
Harasho! {love live memez}

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.490
I am Piroshenko!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.240
I want to work together with a Japanese idol

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:37.040
to create a brand-new brand!{...}

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.250
Let us get right into the audition.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.500
It will last from today to tomorrow.{by the way, are we not will his speaking?}{no, we not, because it's some weird deshou thing that's also probably harasho}

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:49.130
To win, clear the challenges and be the last one remaining.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.010
On your marks, get set...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:57.140
The curtain has been drawn on this fateful audition.{words are machines and if you use curtain too much you might make it stop working}{only once per episode or less is my rule}

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.390
The first task is button sewing.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.850
This is a piece of cake.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.020
Huh?! What's with this?!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.280
This button has no holes!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.990
How unexpected.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.530
A button with no holes is impossible to thread.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.280
How will they thrust past this hurdle?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.250
Where I find no hole, I will make one!{I think this is supposed to be quote-similar, so something something julius caesar}

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.290
Shirogane Lily has completed.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.840
Harasho!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:30.550
Incredible! Four Star Academy's 
Shirogane Lily has cleared the challenge!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.130
That gets me going!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.050
Great job, Lily-senpai!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.060
Four, three,

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.060
two, one...

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.060
Time's up!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:44.060
Anyone who couldn't finish their buttons is out.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.940
Next up is embroidery!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.700
I've finished.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.450
Wh-What quality in such little time!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.450
Harasho!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.330
Last place is out.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.840
Moving on, pattern cutting!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.970
S-Seriously?!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:19.220
Next is creating a brand name and logo design!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.310
Fabulous!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:27.060
Yet two must go!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.820
It's time to announce the three finalists.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:34.280
Naruse Ayumi of Shiny Academy.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.820
As expected.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.330
That's my Ayumi-san!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.500
Mori Kirari of Sunlight Institute.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.660
Yay, I did it!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.540
And finally...

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.710
Shirogane Lily of Four Star Academy!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.420
Yes!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.050
Awesome, she made it to the finals!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.640
Yep! But it looks like she's pushing herself.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.600
Why wouldn't she be into it?

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.310
No, I have a bad feeling about this.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.680
I have to go!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.060
Huh? Go where?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.730
The final trial will be first thing in the morning tomorrow.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.190
Take tonight to rest up.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.240
Yes.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.070
Y-Yes.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.290
What's the matter?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.460
Nothing, I'm fine.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:36.760
<i>So long as I rest soundly tonight, 
my fever will be gone by tomorrow.</i>

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.610
It's coming down hard!{is the academy in such dire straits that they could not offer a chauffeur?}

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.150
We're almost there. Let's hurry. {okay, so, either they've been walking for the entire night through this, or they left at like 4-5 am. they kind of skipped the entire night}{how do you know how far it is? maybe it's like a ten-minute walk}

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.910
<i>Why have I not recovered in the slightest?</i>

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.540
<i>The fever is making my mind hazy...</i>

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.540
Harasho!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.920
Let's get the finals on the road!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.050
The last challenge is to design a complete dress.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.420
The theme is individuality! {because why wouldn't it be}

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.300
Individuality, my specialty!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.810
Self-production is my bread and butter!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:27.560
Show me the ultimate expression of yourself!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.940
On your marks, get set...

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.440
Victory is within my grasp, and I will not loosen my grip!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.440
I'm not gonna lose!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.240
<i>To wear a dress crafted from my heart's love.</i>

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.960
<i>I have come this far in pursuit of that dream!</i>

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.760
Oh, my God!

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.180
Are you all right?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.730
You needn't worry.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:14.150
You're burning up. You can't finish like this! Withdrawal is—

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.770
I will not!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.030
I will not withdraw!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.780
Please allow me to finish this!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:27.160
Only if you take a break. 
There's still plenty of time.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:28.660
Okay.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.340
<i>I'm only a step away from my dream...</i>

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:53.810
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.230
What have we here? Bursting through the door are...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.200
Four Star Academy's Nijino Yume and Sakuraba Rola!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.950
What could they have come for?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.320
Lily-senpai!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.330
What are you doing here?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.460
We wanted to assist you.{cheater}

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.500
I told you that wasn't necessary...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.670
We know! So please let us help you out with everything other than your dress!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.470
What?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:25.050
We brought medicine and energy drinks, and even a pillow!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.600
And not just that!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.600
Look! A coffee maker!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:37.110
You two shouldered these heavy supplies up the mountain all by yourselves?{I don't think I've ever seen the verb shoulder used non-metaphorically}{I meant it to be double}

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.360
Yes!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:44.360
I was just in the mood for a cup of Vienna coffee.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.250
It's delicious.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.580
Thirty minutes remain!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.920
Lily-senpai, can you still make it?

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:05.010
Yes. Thanks to your support, 
I feel rejuvenated and at ease.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.890
Shirogane Lily, ready to release my full power!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.900
Five, four, three,

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.900
two, one!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.320
Time's up!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.610
Let's have everyone present their works.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.660
First, Naruse Ayumi-san.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.910
Of course.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.200
A fashionable design made with fashionable materials.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:38.040
This coord will catch the attention of anyone with their eyes on popular fashion.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.550
Next is Mori Kirari-san.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.800
Okay!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:47.090
I unified the matryoshka from President Piroshenko's motherland, Russia,

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:51.050
with the Japanese kimono to create a Russo-Japanese coord!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.430
Last but not least, Shirogane Lily-san.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:56.940
Yes.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.310
The focal point is the blue rose.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:06.200
Bearing a feminine silhouette while maintaining a cool design, this is the Gothic Rose Coord.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.910
This is the ultimate expression of myself.{it's the same line as before dude}

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.950
A dress I wish to wear from the bottom of my heart.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.500
I see.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.580
We're ready to announce the results!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.710
This wonderful final bout exceeded my expectations.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:29.220
I gave you the theme of individuality, and my selection is based on that.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:34.890
With a design imbued with her natural individuality, unbound by trends and context...

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.730
Shirogane Lily!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.230
You are the victor!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.480
Harasho!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.860
Lily-senpai!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.230
She did it!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.400
Congratulations.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.530
I won... with my dress...

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.990
What is it? Does that not make you happy?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.750
How could I possibly not be happy?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.670
How long I have waited for this moment...

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.750
Save your tears for later.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:10.260
Only with the opening of a shop and a debut show can you say your dream has been fulfilled.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:15.560
Of course. I still have ground to cover before I reach my dream.{what the heck?}

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.640
I will see this through.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.650
Two weeks after the audition.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:30.990
Lily-senpai has been working hard in preparation for the grand opening of the store for her brand, Gothic Victoria.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.580
I'm so excited for opening day.{only tennish more weeks}

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.160
And for her performance.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:36.910
Yeah.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.000
I've got it!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.290
They're so cute!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.670
And stylish!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.920
This is my shop!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.010
Is it to your liking?

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:58.850
This is validation at the end of my lonesome, relentless pursuit of a dream.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.810
Are you saying you made it alone?

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.560
Huh?

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.690
Take a good look.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.810
All of this...

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.610
These are real roses.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.200
They're a gift from your friends.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.240
My friends?

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:23.330
Your friends looked after this shop in your stead, 
busy as you were with preparations for your brand.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.130
I think blue roses would be perfect because they match her dress.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:32.880
Friends who acquired real blue roses for you.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:37.390
Yuri-chan's Dress Coordinate Seminar!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:42.140
Friends who held dress coordination seminars for you.{this one can this}

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.770
Yuzu-sama, please polish it more thoroughly.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:49.400
I already am! And you know how much I hate cleaning.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.740
Friends who made this shop sparkle for you.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.660
They worked hard to support your dream.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.330
Those girls...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.120
Lily-senpai!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.460
Congratulations!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.920
Yume-san!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:13.340
I believed that dreams were meant to 
pursue alone, without relying on anyone else.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.430
But that was a foolish belief.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:21.470
I was unaware of the many people I had leaned on.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.100
Someone was always lending their support.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.230
Truly, I thank you.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.940
Oh no, please raise your head.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.440
I'm just glad I was able to be of use.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:37.570
Me too. It's an honor to be here with you to see your dream fulfilled.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.450
I had a lot of fun too!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.330
Friedrich von Schiller once said: {changing it up because of following lines}{I meant this line, not the next one}

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:49.580
"Friendship doubles our joy and divides our grief." {your line was egyptian, this is the correct one}

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.340
There's a proverb!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.260
And yet it contains an error.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:57.760
My joy is far more than doubled.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.760
It's twenty times—no, even more than that!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.350
Ready, Lily? It's time for the debut show!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.850
How are you feeling?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.190
I've never been better.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:13.690
I will engrave this moment into 
my heart, where it will lie eternal.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:20.620
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:34.770
I'm only going to Russia for a shop 
opening event, so I'll return in two or three days.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:39.270
Um, Lily-senpai. Can I ask you a question?

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:45.150
Now that you have your own brand, 
why didn't you make a Premium Rare Dress?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:49.820
A Premium Rare Dress is, in other words, a top dress.

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:54.790
I am only worthy of wearing one when I myself become the top idol.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.540
So you're saying...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:00.130
First, I must rise to the top of the academy, S4.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:04.380
Only then will I don my Premium Rare Dress.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:07.800
